      <p style="font-size:clamp(1.05rem,1.4vw,1.2rem);line-height:1.55;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.78);max-width:38em;margin:0;">Work out repayments, see what extra payments save you, compare rates before you refix, and check where your deposit sits. Then, if you want the numbers tested against real lender criteria, that's what we're here for.</p>
